  # Here the operator and x have different batch_shape, and are broadcast.
  # This requires a copy, since the output is different size than the input.
  x = ... Shape [1, 2, 3]
  operator.matmul(x)
  ==> Shape [2, 2, 3] Tensor, equal to tf.zeros_like([x, x])
  ```

